      <ul>
        <li>Custom agents, skills &amp; plugins</li>
        <li>MCP development &amp; tool integration</li>
        <li>AI features embedded in applications</li>
        <li>Enterprise agents in the Microsoft ecosystem</li>
        <li>Agent testing &amp; output validation</li>
      </ul>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>AI adoption, research &amp; enablement</summary>
      <ul>
        <li>AI market trends &amp; technology research</li>
        <li>Use case assessment &amp; prototyping</li>
        <li>AI adoption consulting &amp; workflow automation</li>
        <li>Internal training &amp; knowledge sharing</li>
      </ul>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Software engineering, cloud &amp; integrations</summary>
      <ul>
        <li>Full-stack applications &amp; internal tools</li>
        <li>API integration &amp; custom development</li>
        <li>Cloud &amp; serverless deployment, including Azure</li>
        <li>Enterprise SaaS configuration &amp; integration</li>
      </ul>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Product thinking &amp; experience design</summary>
      <ul>
        <li>Business &amp; user requirements</li>
        <li>Feature definition, prioritization &amp; scope</li>
        <li>Interface design, workflows &amp; usability</li>
        <li>Prototyping, user feedback &amp; adoption</li>
      </ul>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Project delivery &amp; collaboration</summary>
      <ul>
        <li>Project ownership, planning &amp; risk management</li>
        <li>Production application &amp; service delivery</li>
        <li>Cross-functional collaboration &amp; stakeholder alignment</li>
        <li>Technical communication &amp; documentation</li>
