    </details>

    <h2 id="interests">Interests</h2>
    <details>
      <summary>Technology</summary>
      <ul>
        <li>Techno-Optimism ⏩</li>
        <li>Artificial Intelligence</li>
        <li>Software Development</li>
        <li>Open source &amp; building in public</li>
        <li>Electric Vehicles (EVs)</li>
        <li>UI/UX Design</li>
